# openminds2cedar

Generate CEDAR template elements from openMINDS schemas.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
uv sync

# Generate a CEDAR element
uv run openminds2cedar generate Subject

# Convert a filled CEDAR instance to openMINDS
uv run openminds2cedar convert instance.json -o output.jsonld
```

## Architecture

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) for module overview.

## Project Structure

```
src/openminds2cedar/
├── registry/       # Schema and field configuration (YAML)
├── generators/     # CEDAR element generation
├── converters/     # CEDAR → openMINDS conversion
└── api/            # CEDAR Workbench API client
```

## Configuration

- `registry/schemas.yaml` - Which openMINDS schemas to generate
- `registry/fields.yaml` - Field-level configuration
- `config.yaml` - Runtime config (API keys, paths)
